  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Campaign to Ban Landmines - Cluster Munitions Coalition (ICBL-CMC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to ICBL-CMC for three-years for targeted APMBC and CCM universalization efforts, with a specific focus on the universalization and implementation in Asian countries. This will include support for campaigners in those countries and outreach in Geneva. Policy and advocacy work focused on implementation of the Siem Reap Angkor Action Plan.</narrative>
  </description>
